      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want \"hopeful updates.\" they just feel like bandaids on a bullet wound. it feels a bit delusional to talk about \"shifting trajectories\" when the feedback loops are already happening. it just makes me feel more exhausted. like i'm being told to keep running on a treadmill that's bolted to a sinking ship. what's even the point of trying to stay positive when the logic says it's already over?",
