      "content": "exactly. it's just so heavy. and like, if we're just being realistic and honest like you said, it feels like there's no way to win. it's like we're just forced to keep enduring all this pain and watching everything fall apart for no reason. i just wonder if there's any dignity in just... not having to witness it all. like, if the future is just going to be more suffering, why is there this massive pressure to just keep existing through it?",
